      <activity id="52031b06-e296-5941-8083-1ce37286d5b5" activityNameId="d840e6a3-e7e1-5fd4-8bc2-5dda07a49433" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, PV, at 3kWp slanted-roof, multi-Si, panel, mounted, at house</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, PV, at 3kWp slanted-roof, multi-Si, panel, mounted, at house
Annual output of grid-connected PV power plants differentiated for roof-top, facade and centralized power plants. Technology and installation type breakdown based on literature (IEA-PVPS Task 1 and Fraunhofer ISE reports) and expert estimates. Average yield based on national statistics (Swissolar annual reports 2012-2018). The lifetime of PV systems is estimated at 30 years and a linear degradation rate of 0.7% per year is assumed (10.5% on average over 30 years) based on the PEFCR PV electricity.;
Synonyms: polycrystalline, multi-crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 3ff629de-31ff-3a95-97f6-4695233b9253
Infrastructure for 3kWp PV plant, water use for cleaning, amount of solar energy transformed to electricity and waste heat emission due to losses of electricity in the system. Annual output, Roof-Top: 976 kWh/kWp.
Location: Operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Electricity production with grid-connected photovoltaic power plants.
Time period: Average yield for 2012-2018.
Production volume: Total PV electricity production in 2018: approximately 2000 TWh in Switzerland.
Sampling: Statistical data for CH. 
Extrapolations: Water demand estimated at 20 L per m2 PV module over life time of the system.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3ff629de-31ff-3a95-97f6-4695233b9253.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
